Here's a new version of the wizard staff. Basically I removed the
(a)pply timeout, so now you can charge it everytime you want and have
enough MP, but I added another drawback: if enough time passed since
the last time the staff was used, some of the energy in it is lost. So
I think this effectively obligates one to constantly wields the staff,
if s/he really wants to make a good use of it. (not massively tested,
though.)
I also added a damage bonus to the staff that uses the stored energy,
so it can be used both as a way to store MP and a decent melee weapon.

The patch and details about the staff are here:
http://bertelli.endofinternet.net/stuffs/wstaff.html

